  "interpretation": [
    "Cached critic fitting is already FP32; actionPrecision=float32 disables autocast only for value/recovery heads and promotes action representations before concatenating numeric features.",
    "The first 256 action-representation columns match the prior GPU run exactly in all 928 states. Numeric inputs and both heads match FP32 cached calculations exactly after the change.",
    "Precision verification and differences in fixed-state actions do not establish lower rollout losses.",
    "The first probe attempt rejected the correct GPU because Torch omits the GPU- UUID prefix; corrected prefix normalization, preserved failure log, then ran on the same assigned L40S."
  ],
